# SalesView Project Rules

## Design system colors
- Background main: `#F1F5F9`
- Card background: `#FFFFFF`
- Primary color: `#1E3A5F`
- Positive metric: `#10B981`
- Negative metric: `#EF4444`
- Text primary: `#0F172A`
- Text secondary: `#64748B`
- Borders/separators: `#E2E8F0`

## Category color palette
- Electrónica: `#3B82F6`
- Ropa: `#8B5CF6`
- Hogar: `#F59E0B`
- Alimentos: `#10B981`
- Deportes: `#EF4444`

## Component architecture
- Keep each UI component in its own file inside `src/components/`.
- Required core components:
  - `Header.jsx`
  - `PeriodFilter.jsx`
  - `KPICards.jsx`
  - `SalesTable.jsx`
  - `CategoryBreakdown.jsx`

## Data source rules
- This project is frontend-only and read-only.
- Data is mock data loaded from local JSON files under `data/`:
  - `sales.json`
  - `team.json`
  - `config.json`
- No backend, no external API calls, and no persistence layer.

## Explicit exclusions ("NO incluir")
- No login or authentication
- No dark mode
- No multi-page routing
- No external charting libraries (Chart.js, Recharts, D3, etc.)
- No export to PDF/Excel
- No real-time data or WebSocket/polling
- No data editing flows
- No tooltips/popovers
- No notifications/alerts
- No footer
